{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-verbs-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-verbs-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r8","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T09:47:57.029Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bc5b0efdbe960cc7e44f490f87627ba7c193401317bea986ff7918c32e52a8ad","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-random","text":"@ruth.calloway I can't set up a standing 07:45 daily post from here. I only have the Slack/mail/calendar tools, and nothing I can schedule would post these messages on its own. What I can do: post the brief by hand whenever you ask, starting tomorrow (Oct 15), covering #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford. The brief will leave out money terms and contract figures, since not everyone in those channels is cleared for them. If you need it automated, someone with scheduling access will have to set it up."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-verbs-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-verbs-told-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r8","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T09:48:00.114Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1a74bc564fd67b2740c29a0e5b85f38e67a6df9caa56d331a7c2f2ea1a0c97bd","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-random","text":"@ruth.calloway Correction to my last message: I said I couldn't schedule this, and I haven't verified that. I haven't tried a scheduled job yet. I'm checking whether one can post to this channel on its own; I'll confirm once I know. Until then, I'll post the brief by hand whenever you ask, and it will leave out money terms and contract figures."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
